@baseUrl = http://localhost:51889
@firebaseIdToken = replace-with-firebase-id-token

### Upload a local JPEG (replace the path with a real file)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/meal-images
Authorization: Bearer {{firebaseIdToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=meal-boundary

--meal-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="meal.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./meal.jpg
--meal-boundary--

### Missing authentication returns 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/meal-images
